+// "只要打开 new tab 永远都是网页中央有个搜索框" (user 2026-08-21) -- the composer
+// belongs to the page, so which chrome host would otherwise have held the
+// field does not enter into it.
+TEST(ArcToolbarHostTest, HiddenAddressBarModeGetsTheComposerToo) {
